rs/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.6.2 stable\n- Reproducible in 4.6 stable\n- Reproducible in 4.5.1 stable\n- Reproducible on master (v4.7.beta.custom_build [aaaf76403])\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable (71f334935) - Fedora Linux 44 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (radeonsi, gfx1201, ACO, DRM 3.64, 7.0.4-200.fc44.x86_64) - AMD Ryzen 5 9600X 6-Core Processor (6 threads) - 30.42 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using Auto Detect to exclude unused features for compiling the Engine, any classes/features used in built-in scripts are not detected and will be excluded anyway.\nI tested it with ProjectSettings, Engine and Node3D.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a built in script, use any feature. Go to Project > Tools > Engine Compilation Configuration Tool and press auto detect. The .gdbuild file will still exclude the class/feature you used. This does not happen with a regular script.\n\nWith the MRP:\nAuto Detect and save .gdbuild file, Node3D will _not_ be excluded.\nRemove **and delete** the regular script file. Auto Detect and save .gdbuild again. Node 3D _will_ be excluded. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[BuiltInScriptMRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27565498/BuiltInScriptMRP.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119378/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119378/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}